n  including free games each month  discounts on games and other content  cloud storage for saved games and access  to online multiplayer the extra tier  includes all of that plus a catalog of  up to 400 ps4 and ps5 games to come over  time this library will include  blockbuster hits from playstation  studios and third party publishers the  premium membership meanwhile has all of  that plus up to 340 additional games  including ps3 games delivered via  streaming and quote beloved classic  games from playstation playstation 2 and  psp available over the cloud and via  download premium also includes cloud  streaming support for some playstation 4  games in supported markets where  playstation now is offered on top of  those perks the highest tier of  playstation now will also include time  limited trials a deluxe version of  playstation plus will be available in  markets that do not currently support  cloud streaming and the deluxe offering  will be priced lower than premium  specific pricing will vary by region  deluxe will also include original  playstation playstation 2 and psp games  to download as well as time limited game  trials and other benefits from the  essential and extra tiers also of note  is when the new edition of playstation  plus begins its rollout in june  playstation now will no longer be  offered as a standalone service going  forward it will be bundled with  playstation plus and existing ps now  members will be migrated to playstation  plus premium at no extra monthly cost  for xbox game pass one of the biggest  benefits and among the most significant  differences from playstation plus is  that all first party games and some  third-party titles launch into game pass  on day one in addition to day one new  releases game pass members across  console and pc get access to a growing  library of titles with new ones being  introduced each month with microsoft  recently taking ownership of zenimax  bethesda's games are in the catalog too  and this will also include the big new  release star field later this year and  the elder scrolls 6 later on similarly  at least some of activision's titles are  expected to join the lineup soon when  microsoft's blockbuster deal to buy  activision blizzard goes through as it's  expected to game pass members also get  discounts on games and content as well  as monthly perks like bonuses for halo  infinite additionally game pass ultimate  and pc game pass members automatically  get access to ea play which is ea's own  subscription service that includes big  back catalog games from the star wars  battlefield and mass effect franchises  among others game pass ultimate the most  expensive tierra game pass also includes  xbox live gold which is required for  online play and provides access to its  own library of free games with gold  titles each month as well as the ability  to stream games from the cloud  content is king and both playstation  plus and game pass offer up games galore  to subscribers those who subscribe to  the playstation plus premium tier will  get access to more than 700 games over  time including titles from across  basically all areas of playstation  dating back to the original playstation  these classic era playstation games have  yet to be announced however but sony  promises more details to come the full  list of newer playstation plus games  hasn't been confirmed yet but death  stranding god of war spider-man  spider-man miles morales mortal kombat  11 and returnal will be there at launch  in june with more to come over time this  is in addition to the hundreds of titles  available through playstation now  streaming service not to mention the  monthly free games that playstation plus  subscribers get on xbox game passes  library is stuffed with more than 100  titles already this is not an infinitely  expanding catalog though because games  cycle in and out game pass ultimate  members also receive new waves of  freebies each month via games with gold  as well as a huge catalog of backwards  compatible titles from the og xbox and  xbox 360 at no extra cost  one of the most pronounced differences  between playstation plus and game pass  comes from day one releases xbox game  passes strongest selling point is how  microsoft's own games and some  third-party titles launched directly  into game pass on day one at no extra  cost to members in 2021 this included  high profile blockbusters like halo  infinite and forza horizon 5 among  others in 2022 all xbox players will get  bethesda's big new release starfield as  well as mlb the show 2022 and sniper  elite 5 among others sony's strategy is  significantly different playstation  bosses jim ryan has said that the cycle  of investment that leads to commercial  payoff could be significantly derailed  if sony were to take that approach quote  in terms of putting our own games into  the service or any of our services upon  their release as you well know this is  not a road that we've gone down in the  past and it's not a road that we're  going to go down with this new service  we feel if we were to do that with the  games that we make at playstation  studios that virtuous cycle will be  broken the level of investment that we  need to make in our studios would not be  possible and we think the knock-on  effect of the quality of the games that  we make would not be something that  gamers want we feel like we are in a  good virtuous cycle with the studios  where the investment delivers success  which enables yet more investment which  delivers yet more success we like that  cycle and we think our gamers like that  cycle how many times can one man say  cycle in a single press release but ryan  went on to say that sony is not strictly  committed to this it could turn around  and change its stance at any moment  based on market trends and other factors  quote the way the world is changing so  very quickly at the moment nothing is  forever so i don't want to cast anything  in stone at this stage all i'm talking  to today is the approach we're taking in  the short term the way our publishing  model works right now it doesn't make  any sense but things can change very  quickly in this industry as we all know  and that's all we know about the  differences between xbox game pass and  the new playstation plus but there's  sure to be a ton more to discuss between  now and when playstation plus relaunches  this june so don't forget to subscribe  so you don't miss any of that coverage  right here on gamespot until then thanks  for watching  [Music]  you

